---
// The Proofworks Engine — a full-width LIGHT interrupt with a soft multicolor
// aurora field. Opaque light background covers the fixed dark canvas/dot-grid.
---
<section class="engine" aria-label="The Proofworks Engine">
  <div class="ewrap">
    <h2 class="eng-title">The Proofworks Engine</h2>
    <p class="eng-h2">How it actually works.</p>

    <hr class="eng-div" />

    <p class="eng-lead">We identify <em class="cv">who can adapt</em>, establish their <em class="cv">baseline</em> through applied work, then develop them beyond everyday AI use into people who can <em class="cv">build and operate useful systems</em>.</p>
    <p class="eng-sub">Participants move from chat-based tools into hands-on work with the technical environments appropriate to their role—terminal tools, APIs, automations, agents, company data, and deployment systems.</p>

    <hr class="eng-div" />

    <h3 class="eng-course-h">Retooling is <em>not</em> another AI course.</h3>
    <div class="eng-steps">
      <div class="eng-step">
        <p class="eng-slabel cb">Frame the problem</p>
        <p class="eng-sbody">It starts with <b>real company problems and real work</b>—not generic content.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="eng-step estab">
        <p class="eng-slabel cb">Establish the baseline</p>
        <p class="eng-sbody">Participants begin with an applied challenge that reveals how they <b>frame problems</b>, handle ambiguity, choose tools, test outputs, and build something usable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="eng-step">
        <p class="eng-slabel cb">Build through real work</p>
        <p class="eng-sbody">They move beyond passive, chat-based AI use into <b>hands-on work</b> with the tools appropriate to the problem—<b><i>terminal environments, APIs, automations, agents, company data, and deployment systems.</i></b></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* full-width light band with a soft multicolor aurora field; opaque base
     covers the fixed constellation canvas behind it */
  .engine { position: relative; color: #191a1e; padding: 94px 0;
    background-color: #f4f3ee;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(55% 46% at 9% 12%, hsla(150, 62%, 55%, 0.15), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(52% 52% at 93% 24%, hsla(224, 72%, 60%, 0.16), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(58% 56% at 66% 106%, hsla(283, 60%, 62%, 0.15), transparent 62%); }
  .ewrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }

  .cg { color: #157a4c; }   /* green */
  .cb { color: #2a5fd0; }   /* blue */
  .cv { color: #7a3fd6; }   /* violet */

  .eng-title { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 96px); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.032em; color: #131418; margin: 0; }
  .eng-h2 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4.2vw, 50px); line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2c2f36; margin: 14px 0 0; }

  .eng-div { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #cfcec6; margin: 42px 0; }

  .eng-lead { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.14; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #171922; margin: 0; max-width: 1000px; }
  .eng-lead em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; }
  .eng-sub { font-size: clamp(17px, 1.9vw, 21px); line-height: 1.5; color: #45484f; margin: 22px 0 0; max-width: 760px; }

  .eng-course-h { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #131418; margin: 0 0 26px; }
  .eng-course-h em { color: #131418; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; }

  .eng-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .eng-step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr; gap: 30px; padding: 26px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #d3d2ca; align-items: start; }
  .eng-step:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid #d3d2ca; }
  .eng-slabel { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 20px);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; }
  .eng-sbody { font-size: clamp(16px, 1.7vw, 19px); line-height: 1.5; color: #3a3d44; margin: 0; }
  .eng-sbody b { color: #131418; font-weight: 700; }
  .eng-sbody i { color: #131418; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .engine { padding: 60px 0; }
    .eng-title { font-size: clamp(38px, 12vw, 62px); line-height: 0.94; }
    .eng-lead { font-size: clamp(23px, 6.4vw, 30px); }
    .eng-step { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; padding: 22px 0; }
    .eng-div { margin: 34px 0; }
  }
</style>
